cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Superfluid: a research memory layer for language models using cellular-sheaf diffusion"
abstract: >-
  A NumPy research implementation of a sheaf-diffusion sequence architecture
  with a bounded, majority-tracking exact-token store and an optional
  PyTorch adapter. Includes machine-checked tests and documented measured
  limitations. It is a research prototype, not a production-ready service.
type: software
version: "1.2.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - large language models
  - memory
  - cellular sheaves
  - persistent homology
  - KV cache
authors:
